      "statusChangeID": null,
      "value": "The best solution might be for them to change the viewpoint settings on the avatar descriptor from a Vector3 to a Transform. So you could just assign a gameobject that both defines the position of the viewpoint and allows you to attach things to it.\n\nA predefined canvas that’s scaled to players fov automatically could also be cool though.",
