      "value": "@{5f30ecee654cd4491456a82f|full_name} more thinking about Avatar scailing\n\nAlso I don't think the viewport scails so a constraint wouldn't work\n\nit just has its in between eye distance scail not the viewport game object (I'm guessing I don't know how that actually works )\n\nMaking it also scail with FOV would be good too but that's a whole nother layer of complexity so my thinking is it should work is As simple as possible\n\nSo it plays nice with Avatar scailing\n\nBut FOV adjustments can be handed by the Avi maker\n\nFor the local part maybe the Avatar HUD Canvus can turn its game object off or not exist for non local (because I don't think the viewport post is networked)",
      "viewerReactions": null,
      "voteID": null
    }
