  "companyID": "58c62e995865713647a7115d",
  "created": "2026-03-22T23:20:18.124Z",
  "deletedAt": null,
  "deletedBy": null,
  "details": "A Avatar HUD Canvus Component that's constraints the game object to the players view (preferably centered per eye because Parallax)\n\nAnd a version of Mobile Particles Additive that renders through everything (except UI) and has a Hue (so its color can be animated)\n\nSince the head bone position Doesn't match view position, attaching Avatar HUD elements to the head bone does not work well and miss aligns when you move (I use VRC head chop so it doesn't scail to 0)\n\nBecause VRC doesn't currently have a Avatar HUD Canvus I use a particle system that aligns with view so the rotation matches but it's position gets miss aligned with movement because it's still just attached to the head bone\n\nNote this would not use Unity UI Canvus",
